@node Top
@top el-rdf

@strong{el-rdf} is an in-memory triple store (RDF graph database) implemented in Emacs Lisp. It provides functionality for storing, querying, and visualizing RDF triples using SPARQL-like operations directly within Emacs.

@strong{Disclaimer:} el-rdf is currently in alpha

@end ifnottex

