@node Quelpa
@section Quelpa

The package @samp{el-rdf} is not currently available from @uref{https://melpa.org/#/, MELPA}, but can be installed
directly from Codeberg with @uref{https://framagit.org/steckerhalter/quelpa, Quelpa}.

Installing with @uref{https://framagit.org/steckerhalter/quelpa, Quelpa} is easy:

@enumerate
@item
Install @uref{https://framagit.org/steckerhalter/quelpa-use-package#installation, quelpa-use-package} (which can be installed directly from MELPA).
@item
Add this form to your init file:
@end enumerate

@lisp
(use-package el-rdf
  :quelpa (el-rdf :fetcher codeberg :repo "ifitzpat/el-rdf"))
@end lisp

